{"__lastUpdated": "2026-09-03T16:42:27.082Z", "__OculusDBType": "Application", "group": 0, "binaryType": 1, "hmd": 6, "__sn": "OculusDB-Official", "blocked": false, "appName": "MetaBlogger", "baseline_offer": null, "priceFormatted": "0.-01", "priceOffsetNumerical": -1, "priceLimboDetected": false, "appHasDiscount": false, "discountEndTime": "0001-01-01T00:00:00", "appHasTrial": false, "appCanBeBought": false, "currency": "", "canonicalName": "alindor-metablogger-android6d0f-3d-apl", "current_gift_offer": null, "current_offer": null, "current_trial_offer": null, "displayName": "MetaBlogger", "display_name": "MetaBlogger", "display_long_description": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content consumption is limited to flat, 2D screens. No matter how immersive the storytelling, you\u2019re still just an observer, not a participant.\n\nMetaBlogger VR revolutionizes content consumption by making it interactive, responsive, and fully immersive. Instead of passively watching a video, you step inside a VR-powered world where AI-driven metabloggers replace traditional human creators. These AI hosts are not just digital avatars\u2014they respond instantly to your questions, adapt to your interests, and engage with you in a way that no pre-recorded video ever could.", "display_long_description_unprocessed": "Every day, millions of people watch online videos, but the experience is completely one-sided. You sit back, watch, and if you have a question, you can only hope for an answer buried in a sea of comments. The creators you follow dictate the pace, the topics, and the flow\u2014there\u2019s no way to engage in real-time.\n\nOn top of that, traditional content con